      "id": "HI-C495-kasrat",
      "sequence": 27200,
      "title": "कसरत (kasrat) — exercise; a workout",
      "headword": "कसरत",
      "romanization": "kasrat",
      "gloss": "exercise; a workout",
      "script": "devanagari",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:f061bbbe25dba8a0",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Hindi for to warm (a sore part), then the Hindi for to cover someone (with a blanket)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: कसरत",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कसरत — kasrat — \"exercise; a workout\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अरुण रोज़ सुबह आधा घंटा कसरत करता है। Aruṇ roz subah ādhā ghaṇṭā kasrat kartā hai. Arun exercises for half an hour every morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कसरत (kasrat) is usually traced to Arabic kathra, \"abundance, a great number\", which reached Hindi through Persian kasrat. The sense \"physical exercise\" is the one Hindi and Urdu use; how it grew from \"abundance\" is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
