              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पचना — pacnā — \"to be digested\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भारी खाना जल्दी नहीं पचता। bhārī khānā jaldī nahīṃ pactā. Heavy food is slow to digest."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): वह खाना पच गया, vah khānā pac gayā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पचना (pacnā) is a tadbhava: CDIAL lists Hindi pācnā, \"to cook\", and from it the intransitive pacnā, \"to be digested\", under Sanskrit pacyátē, \"is cooked, is digested\" (CDIAL 7654). pacānā, \"to digest\", is its transitive partner."
            }
          ]
        },
